# Netlify API Reverse Proxy: proxies /api/* requests to your Render backend
# REPLACE "https://YOUR-RENDER-BACKEND-URL.onrender.com" WITH YOUR ACTUAL RENDER SERVICE URL
/api/*    https://YOUR-RENDER-BACKEND-URL.onrender.com/api/:splat    200

# Client-Side Routing SPA Catch-All
/*        /index.html                                                200
